BiomeShift

This project is a Fabric port for Minecraft 26.3 inspired by, and reusing the
biome-rewrite technique of, BiomeExpansion by Mysticpasta1:

    https://github.com/Mysticpasta1/BiomeExpansion

BiomeExpansion is licensed under the MIT license according to its
`gradle.properties` (`mod_license=MIT`) and its CurseForge listing. The upstream
repository contains no LICENSE file and names no copyright holder, so no
upstream copyright notice could be reproduced verbatim.

The trigger and scoring design are not from the original work: this mod scores
placed blocks against per-biome signature weights instead of converting on a
single mapped block.
